  "statement": "Print the **k most frequent** values of the array. List them from the most frequent to the least frequent; if two values are equally frequent, the **smaller value comes first**.",
  "format": "**Input:** n and k on the first line, then n integers.\n\n**Output:** k values separated by spaces.",
